,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sotora-game/sotora/pulls/8","html_url":"https://github.com/sotora-game/sotora/pull/8","diff_url":"https://github.com/sotora-game/sotora/pull/8.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sotora-game/sotora/pull/8.patch","merged_at":"2021-02-15T15:09:22Z"},"body":"I added a basic main menu and an empty settings menu panel. You can now click \"Play\" to start the game, and while in-game press escape to go back to the main menu. It's almost like a real game! 😄 \r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1015540/107953369-5a44bb80-6f9b-11eb-9431-aa290ca1494b.png)\r\n\r\n**Bug/workaround**\r\nI prevented the cameras from despawning (with FIXME comments) because of an issue in Bevy (bevyengine/bevy#1452) where the cameras seemingly don't get removed from the `ActiveCameras`, causing the game to panic. So if you go back and forth between the menus and the game several times, you may end up with a bunch of unused cameras somewhere(?). But everything still seems to work even if we don't despawn the cameras so I think this is fine at this point.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sotora-game/sotora/issues/8/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sotora-game/sotora/issues/8/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/779792087","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1452#issuecomment-779792087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1452","id":779792087,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3OTc5MjA4Nw==","user":{"login":"woubuc","id":1015540,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTU1NDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1015540?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc","html_url":"https://github.com/woubuc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-16T12:01:22Z","updated_at":"2021-02-16T12:34:47Z","body":"I was able to workaround this panic using the following `on_state_exit` system code, right before despawning the cameras:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nfn deactivate_cameras(\r\n    mut cameras: ResMut<ActiveCameras>,\r\n    query: Query<&Camera>,\r\n) {\r\n    for camera in query.iter() {\r\n        if let Some(name) = &camera.name {\r\n            cameras.cameras.insert(name.clone(), None);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n(See sotora-game/sotora#22 for workaround context)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/779792087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"woubuc","id":1015540,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTU1NDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1015540?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc","html_url":"https://github.com/woubuc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woubuc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com